. It is a simple golden amulet!   > ","room":46,"player":202,"diff":[{"id":35,"n":"shiny object","before":{"n":"shiny object","p":46,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"shiny object","p":0,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}},{"id":39,"n":"golden amulet","before":{"n":"golden amulet","p":0,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"golden amulet","p":202,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"GET AMULET","reply":">GET AMULET You are already wearing it. The icy waters are taking their toll. You will not be able to hold out much longer. You run out of air and return to the surface. On the Lake   > ","room":48,"player":202,"diff":[{"id":202,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":46,"c":0,"o":0,"a":1},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":48,"c":0,"o":0,"a":1}}]},{"cmd":"W","reply":">W Western Shore You are on the western shore of the lake. The ground here is quite hard, but a few sickly reeds manage to grow near the water's edge. The only path leads into the rock to the south.   > ","room":45,"player":202,"diff":[{"id":202,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":48,"c":0,"o":0,"a":1},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":45,"c":0,"o":0,"a":1}}]},{"cmd":"S","reply":">S Scenic Vista You are in a small chamber carved in the rock, with the sole exit to the north. Mounted on one wall is a table labelled \"Scenic Vista,\" whose featureless surface is angled toward you. One might believe that the table was used to indicate points of interest in the view from this spot, like those found in many parks. On the other hand, your surroundings are far from spacious and by no stretch of the imagination could this spot be considered scenic. An indicator above the table reads \"III\". Mounted on one wall is a flaming torch, which fills the room with a flickering light.   > ","room":43,"player":202,"diff":[{"id":202,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":45,"c":0,"o":0,"a":1},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":43,"c":0,"o":0,"a":1}}]},{"cmd":"GET TORCH","reply":">GET TORCH Taken.   > ","room":43,"player":202,"diff":[{"id":41,"n":"torch","before":{"n":"torch","p":43,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0},"after":{"n":"torch","p":202,"c":0,"o":0,"a":0}}]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":">WAIT Time passes... The indicator above the table flickers briefly, then changes to \"IV\".   > ","room":43,"player":202,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":">WAIT Time passes...   > ","room":43,"player":202,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":">WAIT Time passes... The indicator above the table flickers briefly, then changes to \"I\".   > ","room":43,"player":202,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"TOUCH TABLE","reply":">TOUCH TABLE You touch the table and are instantly transported to another place!   Timber Room This is a long and narrow passage, which is cluttered with broken timbers. A wide passage comes from the east and turns at the west end of the room into a very narrow passageway. From the west comes a strong draft. There is a broken timber here.   > ","room":25,"player":202,"diff":[{"id":202,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":43,"c":0,"o":0,"a":1},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":25,"c":0,"o":0,"a":1}}]},{"cmd":"GET CAN","reply":">GET CAN You can't see any can here.   > ","room":25,"player":202,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":">WAIT Time passes... You suddenly find yourself back in the viewing room!   > ","room":43,"player":202,"diff":[{"id":202,"n":"cretin","before":{"n":"cretin","p":25,"c":0,"o":0,"a":1},"after":{"n":"cretin","p":43,"c":0,"o":0,"a":1}}]},{"cmd":"WAIT","reply":">WAIT Time passes... The indicator above the table flickers briefly, then changes to \"II\".   > ","room":43,"player":202,"diff":[]},{"cmd":"TOUCH TABLE","reply":">TOUCH TABLE You touch the table and are instantly transported to another place!   Room 8 This is a small chamber carved out of the rock at the end of a short crawl. On the wall is crudely chiseled the number \"8\". The only apparent exit, to the east, seems to be a blur and a loud, whirring sound resounds through the rock. A spray can is in the corner. In large type is the legend \"Frobozz Magic Grue Repellent.\"   > ","room":18,"player":202,